[{:db/id 17592186078589 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-fbf85b19-bc66-596e-8aa5-463e28e677ea"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186078590 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-013a6ab9-35f4-5a21-b21c-f8fd4e726466"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-fbf85b19-bc66-596e-8aa5-463e28e677ea" :question/id #uuid "fbf85b19-bc66-596e-8aa5-463e28e677ea" :question/math-academy-id "q-337842" :question/problem "Given that $D=3{x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}-2,$ what is $D(y)$ for $y=x-5?$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=3{x}^{2},{f}_{1}=-x,$ and ${f}_{0}=-2.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D(x-5) \\\\  & =(3{x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}-2)(x-5) \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(x-5)-x\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x-5)-2(x-5) \\\\  & =3{x}^{2}\\cdot 0-x\\cdot 1-2x+10 \\\\  & =10-3x\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-8afc7adc-5a21-5274-a5f6-0ea02bdd2cb9"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-8afc7adc-5a21-5274-a5f6-0ea02bdd2cb9" :answer-field/id #uuid "8afc7adc-5a21-5274-a5f6-0ea02bdd2cb9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d0fc8ffc-6f90-5b2d-89f4-fba4f7227db1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ad0872b3-dcd3-51dc-9d2f-3beeca91ae9e" "answer-148704c0-66d6-5a7a-bcfa-a356fdfee3e7" "answer-ae217ed4-c1eb-595c-8665-669047155b06" "answer-d0fc8ffc-6f90-5b2d-89f4-fba4f7227db1" "answer-a151a26f-0185-5b72-ad6e-e8d97e752462"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ad0872b3-dcd3-51dc-9d2f-3beeca91ae9e" :answer/id #uuid "ad0872b3-dcd3-51dc-9d2f-3beeca91ae9e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-148704c0-66d6-5a7a-bcfa-a356fdfee3e7" :answer/id #uuid "148704c0-66d6-5a7a-bcfa-a356fdfee3e7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ae217ed4-c1eb-595c-8665-669047155b06" :answer/id #uuid "ae217ed4-c1eb-595c-8665-669047155b06" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10+3x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d0fc8ffc-6f90-5b2d-89f4-fba4f7227db1" :answer/id #uuid "d0fc8ffc-6f90-5b2d-89f4-fba4f7227db1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10-3x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-a151a26f-0185-5b72-ad6e-e8d97e752462" :answer/id #uuid "a151a26f-0185-5b72-ad6e-e8d97e752462" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3x-10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-013a6ab9-35f4-5a21-b21c-f8fd4e726466" :question/id #uuid "013a6ab9-35f4-5a21-b21c-f8fd4e726466" :question/math-academy-id "q-337849" :question/problem "If $D(y)=xy\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}-y\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+4y,$ then $D({x}^{2}-3x)=$" :question/worked-solution "The given operator is a second-order differential operator of the form\n\n$$\nD(y)={f}_{2}(x,y)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}y}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}+{f}_{1}(x,y)\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}+{f}_{0}(x,y)y\n$$\n\nwith ${f}_{2}=xy,{f}_{1}=-y,$ and ${f}_{0}=4.$\n\nTo compute $D(y),$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y={x}^{2}-3x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D({x}^{2}-3x) & =x({x}^{2}-3x)\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}({x}^{2}-3x)-({x}^{2}-3x)\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({x}^{2}-3x)+4({x}^{2}-3x) \\\\  & =x({x}^{2}-3x)\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2x-3)-({x}^{2}-3x)(2x-3)+4({x}^{2}-3x) \\\\  & =x({x}^{2}-3x)\\cdot 2-({x}^{2}-3x)(2x-3)+4({x}^{2}-3x) \\\\  & =2{x}^{3}-6{x}^{2}-2{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+6{x}^{2}-9x+4{x}^{2}-12x \\\\  & =7{x}^{2}-21x \\\\  & =7x(x-3)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ada71037-9568-53ad-8084-566ff6d93eeb"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ada71037-9568-53ad-8084-566ff6d93eeb" :answer-field/id #uuid "ada71037-9568-53ad-8084-566ff6d93eeb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-99683a50-a2e0-5574-b392-ab97ccf08e30" :answer-field/choices ["answer-222969f9-58f5-5eaf-a95c-a222814267da" "answer-b2f9b738-9d10-511a-bb0d-c26b4c5ea3fa" "answer-8bac3d9f-afab-54c5-9178-6a62e26c0328" "answer-99683a50-a2e0-5574-b392-ab97ccf08e30" "answer-9976156a-3f38-595e-80df-31172f261865"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-222969f9-58f5-5eaf-a95c-a222814267da" :answer/id #uuid "222969f9-58f5-5eaf-a95c-a222814267da" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7x(3-x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b2f9b738-9d10-511a-bb0d-c26b4c5ea3fa" :answer/id #uuid "b2f9b738-9d10-511a-bb0d-c26b4c5ea3fa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7x(x+3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8bac3d9f-afab-54c5-9178-6a62e26c0328" :answer/id #uuid "8bac3d9f-afab-54c5-9178-6a62e26c0328" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7x(x-1)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-99683a50-a2e0-5574-b392-ab97ccf08e30" :answer/id #uuid "99683a50-a2e0-5574-b392-ab97ccf08e30" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7x(x-3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9976156a-3f38-595e-80df-31172f261865" :answer/id #uuid "9976156a-3f38-595e-80df-31172f261865" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "x(7x-3)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "activity-d94bb670-9ae3-5e3f-a2c8-33c1515f220f" :activity/id #uuid "d94bb670-9ae3-5e3f-a2c8-33c1515f220f" :activity/title "Differential Operators" :activity/type :activity.type/review :activity/scope 17592186048202 :activity/course 1759218604